Subject: [PATCH 08/13] fdm: allocate the PLIC fields only with PLIC (F 80)

nX, nY, nZ, Alpha, phasemarker and the 12 vof sub-fractions (vof_nt ...
vof_sbw) are only used by the PLIC classes, but were allocated in every
CFD run (17 fields, 136 bytes per cell incl. ghost cells). field_base /
field / field4 take an optional allocate flag (default true); fdm passes
