Subject: [PATCH 11/13] Regression: re-bless the MPI cases (CFL minimum over
 all ranks)

cfd_3d_dambreak_obstacle, cfd_3d_heave_sphere_6dof, cfd_3d_heave_sphere_6dof_kepsilon,
cfd_3d_heave_sphere_6dof_rk3, cfd_3d_pier_komega, cfd_3d_pier_komega_t33,
